ALTCHA widget (custom element <altcha-widget>), vendored, not a CDN dependency.

Source:  https://www.npmjs.com/package/altcha  (altcha-org/altcha)
Version: 1.2.0
License: MIT (c) Daniel Regeci / ALTCHA
Fetched: 2026-07-28 from https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/altcha@1.2.0/dist/altcha.min.js

Only the trailing //# sourceMappingURL comment was removed (its map is not
vendored). The file is otherwise the published build, served from our own
origin. It solves the standard SHA-256 proof-of-work our /altcha/challenge
endpoint issues; no request leaves the page.
